<title>BELGIUM: Glaverbel H1 1996 net 227 mln bfr.</title>
<headline>Glaverbel H1 1996 net 227 mln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit		   227  vs   261</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		    298  vs   366</p>
<p>    Cons current profit		392  vs   550</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgium's Glaverbel SA is a top four European glass maker controlled by Japan's Asahi Glass Co. Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales (blns)   18.34  vs 19.14</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit(blns)   1.01  vs  1.56</p>
<p>Cons financial charges</p>
<p>    Cash flow (blns)		  3.06  vs  3.59</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
